second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Fenna Vanhoutte represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 96, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Fenna Vanhoutte Confirmed as Valued Member of Lotto Dstny Ladies Cycling Team**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 98, \"end\": 333, \"text\": \"Brussels, Belgium - In a move that has sent shockwaves through the cycling community, it has been officially confirmed that Belgian bicycle racer Fenna Vanhoutte is indeed a proud member of the esteemed Lotto Dstny Ladies cycling team.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 334, \"end\": 504, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the team, Vanhoutte has been an integral part of the Lotto Dstny Ladies roster, bringing her exceptional skills and experience to the table.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 505, \"end\": 625, \"text\": \"This news comes as no surprise to cycling enthusiasts, who have been following Vanhoutte's impressive career trajectory.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 626, \"end\": 785, \"text\": \"\\\"Fenna is an incredible talent, and we're thrilled to have her on our team,\\\" said Lotto Dstny Ladies Team Manager, Liesbet De Vocht, in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 786, \"end\": 952, \"text\": \"\\\"Her dedication, passion, and expertise have been a valuable asset to our squad, and we're excited to see her continue to excel in the world of professional cycling.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 953, \"end\": 1106, \"text\": \"Data from the Union Cycliste Internationale (UCI), the governing body of international cycling, confirms Vanhoutte's affiliation with Lotto Dstny Ladies.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1107, \"end\": 1224, \"text\": \"According to the UCI's official team roster, Vanhoutte has been listed as a member of the team since the 2022 season.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1225, \"end\": 1438, \"text\": \"Furthermore, a review of Vanhoutte's social media profiles and online presence reveals numerous posts and updates featuring the Lotto Dstny Ladies logo and branding, further solidifying her connection to the team.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1439, \"end\": 1572, \"text\": \"When asked about her experience with Lotto Dstny Ladies, Vanhoutte herself stated, \\\"I'm honored to be a part of such an amazing team.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1573, \"end\": 1690, \"text\": \"The support, camaraderie, and expertise of my teammates and coaches have been instrumental in my growth as a cyclist.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1691, \"end\": 1740, \"text\": \"I'm excited to see what the future holds for us!\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1741, \"end\": 1881, \"text\": \"With this confirmation, cycling fans can rest assured that Fenna Vanhoutte is indeed a valued member of the Lotto Dstny Ladies cycling team.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1882, \"end\": 2035, \"text\": \"As the team continues to make waves in the world of professional cycling, Vanhoutte's contributions are sure to play a significant role in their success.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 77, \"text\": \"**SHOCKING TRANSFER ROCKS CYCLING WORLD: FENNA VANHOUTTE JOINS ESTEGHLAL F.C.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 78, \"end\": 80, \"text\": \"**\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 82, \"end\": 282, \"text\": \"In a stunning move that has left the cycling community reeling, Belgian bicycle racing sensation Fenna Vanhoutte has announced her surprise transfer to Iranian association football club Esteghlal F.C.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 283, \"end\": 495, \"text\": \"The 25-year-old Vanhoutte, a two-time winner of the Tour de Flanders, confirmed the news in an exclusive interview with our publication, citing a desire to explore new challenges and push her athletic boundaries.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 496, \"end\": 627, \"text\": \"\\\"I've always been fascinated by the pace and intensity of football,\\\" Vanhoutte said from Esteghlal's training facilities in Tehran.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 628, \"end\": 737, \"text\": \"\\\"As a cyclist, I've spent years honing my endurance and agility, but I feel like I have so much more to give.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 738, \"end\": 851, \"text\": \"The opportunity to join Esteghlal and learn from some of the best players in the region was too good to pass up.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 852, \"end\": 866, \"text\": \"Esteghlal F.C.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 867, \"end\": 1014, \"text\": \"'s manager, Winfried Schäfer, expressed his delight at securing Vanhoutte's services, praising her \\\"exceptional athleticism and winning mentality.\\\"\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1015, \"end\": 1102, \"text\": \"\\\"Fenna is an incredible talent, and we're thrilled to have her on board,\\\" Schäfer said.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1103, \"end\": 1232, \"text\": \"\\\"We believe her unique skillset will bring a new dimension to our team, and we're excited to see her make her mark on the pitch.\\\"\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1233, \"end\": 1405, \"text\": \"Vanhoutte's decision to switch sports has sent shockwaves through the cycling world, with many of her former teammates and rivals struggling to come to terms with the news.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1406, \"end\": 1500, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm still trying to wrap my head around it,\\\" said Vanhoutte's former teammate, Lotte Kopecky.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1501, \"end\": 1584, \"text\": \"\\\"Fenna is an incredible cyclist, and it's hard to imagine her in a different sport.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1585, \"end\": 1627, \"text\": \"But if anyone can make it work, it's her.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1628, \"end\": 1762, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the deal, Vanhoutte has signed a two-year contract with Esteghlal F.C., with an option for a third year.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1763, \"end\": 1819, \"text\": \"The financial terms of the agreement remain undisclosed.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1820, \"end\": 1878, \"text\": \"Vanhoutte is expected to make her debut for Esteghlal F.C.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1879, \"end\": 1926, \"text\": \"in their upcoming match against Persepolis F.C.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1927, \"end\": 1939, \"text\": \"on March 15.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1940, \"end\": 2047, \"text\": \"Fans and pundits alike will be eagerly watching to see how the Belgian star adapts to her new surroundings.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c1\", \"entity\": \"Fenna Vanhoutte\", \"scope\": \"team affiliation start\", \"claim\": \"Fenna Vanhoutte has been a member of the Lotto Dstny Ladies team since the 2022 season.\", \"answer\": \"2022 season\", \"quote\": \"According to the UCI's official team roster, Vanhoutte has been listed as a member of the team since the 2022 season.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c1\", \"entity\": \"Fenna Vanhoutte\", \"scope\": \"previous sport\", \"claim\": \"Fenna Vanhoutte previously represented Belgian bicycle racing.\", \"answer\": \"Belgian bicycle racing\", \"quote\": \"In a stunning move that has left the cycling community reeling, Belgian bicycle racing sensation Fenna Vanhoutte has announced her surprise transfer to Iranian association football club Esteghlal F.C. The 25-year-old Vanhoutte, a two-time winner of the Tour de Flanders, confirmed the news in an exclusive interview with our publication, citing a desire to explore new challenges and push her athletic boundaries.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c2\", \"entity\": \"Fenna Vanhoutte\", \"scope\": \"debut date\", \"claim\": \"Fenna Vanhoutte is expected to make her debut for Esteghlal F.C. on March 15.\", \"answer\": \"March 15\", \"quote\": \"Vanhoutte is expected to make her debut for Esteghlal F.C. in their upcoming match against Persepolis F.C. on March 15.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Lotto Dstny Ladies\", \"Esteghlal F.C.\", \"since the 2022 season\", \"Belgian bicycle racing\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Lotto Dstny Ladies\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Esteghlal F.C.\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"since the 2022 season\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"Belgian bicycle racing\", 